ation, source outage simulation).\\n- Consider updating the admin guide (currently references MySQL 5.1/5.5 testing) once the fix/feature lands, to reflect supported MySQL 8.x behavior and clarify whether manual promotion remains the documented production path.\\n- Relevant connector settings called out by reporter: `secondsBeforeRetrySource`, `queriesBeforeRetrySource`, `initialTimeout` — may need tuned defaults or documentation if the new implementation still relies on MySQL Connector/J failover semantics.\\n\\n</details>\"}"
